        {
          "id": 3207983306,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "It was:\n\n* fetching 2 bytes in big-endian order, starting from the byte before it was interested in, then casting away the preceding byte that it wasn't interested in\n* adding the FT_UINT8 field highlighting only the correct byte\n* advancing the offset by 1 byte\n\nwhich was strange, but I think it is correct and less confusing now",
